<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Arden transactions seen up.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Arden transactions seen up.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- EVEREN Securities Inc said Wednesday it increased its transaction estimates on Arden Realty Group Inc to a range of $300 million to $400 million from a previous estimate of $160 million.</p>
<p>-- It also increased its intermediate six-month price target on the stock to $27 from $25.25. EVEEREN's earnings per share estimates are unchanged at $1.82 for FY96, $2.10 for FY97 and $2.45 for FY98.</p>
<p>-- Arden was trading unchanged at 25-5/8.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
